---
// How It Works component
---
<section id="how" class="section-pad" style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:112px 32px 0">
  <div style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#AAEC58">How it works</div>
  <h2 class="section-title" style="margin:14px 0 0;font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.028em;max-width:560px">
    Prop your phone. Start. Go.
  </h2>
  <div class="how-grid" style="margin-top:42px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px">
    <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);border-radius:22px;padding:28px 26px 30px">
      <div style="font:700 15px 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:#AAEC58;color:#0B0E11;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">01</div>
      <div style="margin-top:20px;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em">Standard push-ups first</div>
      <p style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#8b99b0">Standard push-ups, front view. Incline, knee, and diamond are next, then squats.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);border-radius:22px;padding:28px 26px 30px">
      <div style="font:700 15px 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:#AAEC58;color:#0B0E11;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">02</div>
      <div style="margin-top:20px;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em">Set the phone down</div>
      <p style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#8b99b0">About four feet away at floor level, whole body in frame. A countdown gives you time to get in position.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);border-radius:22px;padding:28px 26px 30px">
      <div style="font:700 15px 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:#AAEC58;color:#0B0E11;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">03</div>
      <div style="margin-top:20px;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em">Just do the work</div>
      <p style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#8b99b0">Reps count themselves. Voice cues keep you honest without looking at the screen. Stop when you're done.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
